--- !u!114 &968397419
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 968397418}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7b30be7afae079b499303176a7d752e6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Slime
  style1:
  - "The blob alien does not care for your confidence, and doesn\u2019t even let
    you get out the excuse you came up with for entering, just keeps shlorping towards
    you and when your raise your hand it sinks into the smooth, sticky substance
    this crew member is made of."
  - You flee.
  style2:
  - "The door doesn\u2019t open fast enough, and the alien is shaking so much that
    little globs of goo are flying off it. A few land on your skin and feel oddly
    cool and smooth, and then the blob is closer and starts trying to absorb you."
  - Thankfully the door swishes open before more than your arm has sunk into it.
  - You flee.
  style3:
  - "It doesn\u2019t dodge, just keeps advancing, and your punches and kicks just
    leave you trying to pull your limbs from the sticky, cool substance that makes
    up its entire body. When it gets to the point you very nearly stay stuck, a leg
    and an arm and some of your torso ensconced in slick goop until you wrench yourself
    free with a desperate lurch, you race to the door and pry it open as the alien
    continues to slowly advance."
  - You flee.
  style4:
  - "The alien does not care for your excuses or your small talk, just keeps advancing,
    and when you realize you\u2019re nearly backed into the wall you quickly sidestep
    and get the door open, the crew member shlorping towards you at the same slow
    yet somehow menacing pace."
  - You flee.
  style5:
  - The door takes too long, and the alien is too close, and just as you feel cool
    slime pressing to your back and trying to draw you into it, the door finally
    swishes open.
  - You flee.
  flavors:
  - Stand your ground and exude an aura of confidence.
  - Scramble to open the door, apologizing.
  - Calmly apologize, stating that all doors look alike and you thought this was
    your room.
  - Back away and try to leave.
  - Fight the slime.
  points: 0a0000000a0000000a0000000a0000000a000000
